<!--
============================================================================
 00_overview.html · 赛道分析 · 执行摘要模板（v0.1.0）
============================================================================

这是一份**骨架版**模板——直接复制到 reports/<run_id>/00_overview.html，
然后按下面三个规则填内容：

  1. `{{...}}` 占位符 → 用 sources.json / data_index.md 的具体值替换。
     大数字（市场规模 / 营收 / 用户数等）走"万 / 亿"展示规则；字段不可得时
     数值位置显示 "—"，单位留空。

  2. `<!-- TODO(章节): ... -->` 注释 → 这里必须写实际拆解内容，
     注释里列出了"该写什么"和"该用什么 HTML 结构"，**不要照搬注释里的措辞**——
     它只是指引，不是文案。写完后请删掉这条 TODO 注释。

  3. 本份 HTML 是引流型摘要，**不放 qa-card·必须答的问题**——封面摘要的目的是
     30 秒拉住读者，不做拷问。深度问答留给 01-05。

填完后做两件事：
  · 顶部数据图区直接写内联 <svg viewBox="0 0 800 360">（市场规模 3 年走势），禁止外链图片，禁止任何 PNG 占位符
  · 生成 index.json / index.md（schema 见 SKILL.md）

**不要**改 head 里的 CSS / Tailwind config / 字体；改了视觉一致性就垮。
**不要**加 `<header>` sticky 顶栏；左侧 sticky 目录 + 行内目录已足够。
**不要**新增 JS——本骨架严格禁 JS。
============================================================================
-->
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>{{track_keyword}} · 赛道分析 · 执行摘要</title>

  <!-- 字体：阿里巴巴普惠体 3（chinese-fonts-cdn，自动 subset + woff2） + JetBrains Mono（代码 / 数字） -->
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://chinese-fonts-cdn.deno.dev" crossorigin>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://chinese-fonts-cdn.deno.dev/packages/AlibabaPuHuiTi-3/dist/AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-55-Regular/result.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://chinese-fonts-cdn.deno.dev/packages/AlibabaPuHuiTi-3/dist/AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-65-Medium/result.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://chinese-fonts-cdn.deno.dev/packages/AlibabaPuHuiTi-3/dist/AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-85-Bold/result.css">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    /* 把 chinese-fonts-cdn 的三个 package 别名到统一的 "Alibaba PuHuiTi" 家族，
       通过 font-weight 自动选权重。`local()` 命中已注册的 webfont 家族，
       不会触发额外的网络请求。 */
    @font-face {
      font-family: 'Alibaba PuHuiTi';
      font-weight: 400;
      font-style: normal;
      font-display: swap;
      src: local('AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-55-Regular'), local('Alibaba PuHuiTi 3 55 Regular');
    }
    @font-face {
      font-family: 'Alibaba PuHuiTi';
      font-weight: 500;
      font-style: normal;
      font-display: swap;
      src: local('AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-65-Medium'), local('Alibaba PuHuiTi 3 65 Medium');
    }
    @font-face {
      font-family: 'Alibaba PuHuiTi';
      font-weight: 600;
      font-style: normal;
      font-display: swap;
      src: local('AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-65-Medium'), local('Alibaba PuHuiTi 3 65 Medium');
    }
    @font-face {
      font-family: 'Alibaba PuHuiTi';
      font-weight: 700;
      font-style: normal;
      font-display: swap;
      src: local('AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-85-Bold'), local('Alibaba PuHuiTi 3 85 Bold');
    }
  </style>

  <!-- Tailwind CDN with Weelume brand config -->
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <script>
    tailwind.config = {
      theme: {
        extend: {
          colors: {
            ink: '#F5F5F7',
            'ink-soft': '#D4D4D8',
            muted: '#8A8A94',
            canvas: '#050507',
            surface: '#0D0D12',
            'surface-2': '#141420',
            hairline: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.08)',
            'hairline-strong': 'rgba(255,255,255,0.16)',
            accent: '#A78BFA',
            'accent-2': '#22D3EE',
            'accent-3': '#F472B6',
            report: '#10b981',
            'report-deep': '#064e3b',
            'report-soft': 'rgba(16,185,129,0.08)',
          },
          fontFamily: {
            sans: ['"Alibaba PuHuiTi"', '"AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-55-Regular"', '"PingFang SC"', '"Microsoft YaHei"', 'system-ui', 'sans-serif'],
            serif: ['"Alibaba PuHuiTi"', '"AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-85-Bold"', '"PingFang SC"', '"Microsoft YaHei"', 'system-ui', 'sans-serif'],
            mono: ['"JetBrains Mono"', 'ui-monospace', 'SFMono-Regular', 'Menlo', 'Monaco', 'Consolas', 'monospace'],
          },
        }
      }
    }
  </script>

  <style>
    :root { color-scheme: dark; }
    html { scrollbar-gutter: stable; }
    html, body {
      margin: 0; padding: 0;
      min-height: 100%;
      background-color: #050507;
      color: #F5F5F7;
      font-family: 'Alibaba PuHuiTi', 'AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-55-Regular', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', system-ui, sans-serif;
      font-feature-settings: "palt";
      font-variant-numeric: lining-nums proportional-nums;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
      text-rendering: optimizeLegibility;
    }
    h1, h2, h3, h4, h5, h6 {
      font-family: 'Alibaba PuHuiTi', 'AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-85-Bold', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', system-ui, sans-serif;
      font-optical-sizing: auto;
      font-feature-settings: "palt";
    }
    /* 报告里的"中文衬线大字"位（h1/h2 + 一句话答卷 + stats 数字）
       原本走 Noto Serif SC，现在统一切到普惠体 Bold——保留 class 名兼容
       现存模板和已有报告，不改 markup。 */
    .font-serif-zh {
      font-family: 'Alibaba PuHuiTi', 'AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-85-Bold', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', system-ui, sans-serif;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }
    ::selection { background-color: rgba(167, 139, 250, 0.35); color: #fff; }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 10px; }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: transparent; }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      border-radius: 9999px;
      border: 2px solid transparent;
      background-clip: padding-box;
    }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.18); background-clip: padding-box; }

    /* Hero 一句话答卷渐变文字 */
    .text-shimmer {
      background: linear-gradient(120deg, #F5F5F7 0%, #A78BFA 40%, #22D3EE 70%, #F5F5F7 100%);
      background-size: 200% 200%;
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      background-clip: text;
      color: transparent;
      animation: shimmerText 12s linear infinite;
    }
    @keyframes shimmerText {
      0% { background-position: 0% 50%; }
      100% { background-position: 200% 50%; }
    }

    .glass {
      background: rgba(13,13,18,0.55);
      backdrop-filter: saturate(160%) blur(18px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: saturate(160%) blur(18px);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    }
    .accent-bar { border-left: 3px solid #10b981; }
    .accent-bar-deep { border-left: 3px solid #064e3b; }
    .zh-justify { text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; }

    /* "必须答的问题" 答疑卡片 */
    .qa-card {
      border-left: 3px solid #10b981;
      background: rgba(16,185,129,0.05);
      padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
      margin: 1.5rem 0;
      backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    }
    .qa-card-label {
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 10.5px;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.35em;
      color: #10b981;
      margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    }

    /* 表格 */
    table.report-table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      margin: 1.25rem 0;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    table.report-table thead th {
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
      padding: 0.75rem 0.85rem;
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 10.5px;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      color: #b8aa96;
      text-align: left;
    }
    table.report-table tbody td {
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      padding: 0.75rem 0.85rem;
      vertical-align: top;
      color: #D4D4D8;
      line-height: 1.85;
    }
    table.report-table tbody tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }

    /* 章节分割 */
    .chapter-divider {
      text-align: center;
      letter-spacing: 1em;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
      font-size: 16px;
      margin: 3.5rem 0;
    }

    /* 引用块 */
    blockquote.report-quote {
      border-left: 3px solid #10b981;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
      padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
      margin: 1.5rem 0;
      backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      color: #e7dfd4;
      font-size: 15.5px;
      line-height: 1.95;
    }
    blockquote.report-quote cite {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 0.75rem;
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 11.5px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      color: #10b981;
      font-style: normal;
    }

    /* 内联 cite（作品标题引用） */
    cite { font-style: normal; color: #34d399; font-weight: 500; }

    /* 框架角标 */
    .framework-tag {
      display: inline-block;
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #8A8A94;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      padding: 2px 8px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      margin-left: 0.5rem;
      vertical-align: middle;
    }

    /* 正文段落 */
    .prose-body { font-size: 15px; line-height: 2.05; color: #d6cfc4; }
    .prose-body p { margin-bottom: 18px; }
    .prose-body code {
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 13px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
      padding: 1px 6px;
      border-radius: 3px;
      color: #10b981;
    }

    /* 小节标题 */
    .subhead {
      border-left: 3px solid #10b981;
      padding-left: 0.85rem;
      margin: 2.5rem 0 1rem;
      font-family: 'Alibaba PuHuiTi', 'AlibabaPuHuiTi-3-65-Medium', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', system-ui, sans-serif;
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 600;
      line-height: 1.4;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      color: #fffdf7;
    }

    strong { color: #fffdf7; font-weight: 600; }

    /* 切片配图 grid（参见 SKILL.md §写作规则·切片配图建议）
       每条作品配图必须有 figcaption 解释该画面证明什么判断；
       alt / figcaption 都不允许出现内部词（样本 / 关键帧 / pos N 等） */
    .frame-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 12px;
      margin: 1.5rem 0;
    }
    .frame-grid img {
      width: 100%;
      aspect-ratio: 9 / 16;
      object-fit: cover;
      border-radius: 8px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      display: block;
    }
    .frame-grid figcaption {
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 11px;
      color: #8A8A94;
      margin-top: 6px;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    /* 关键判断 / 压力测试卡片 */
    .judge-card {
      border-radius: 0.5rem;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
      padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
      margin: 1rem 0;
    }
    .judge-card .label {
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 10.5px;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.3em;
      color: #34d399;
      margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    }

    /* 来源脚注：嵌在正文或大字数字中的「（来源：XX，年份）」标记。
       强制小字 + 浅色 + 等宽，避免继承父级字号（如 text-4xl 的大数字）。
       white-space:nowrap 让每条脚注作为不可拆分的原子单位换行。 */
    .citation {
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 400;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      color: #8A8A94;
      vertical-align: baseline;
      margin-left: 0.4em;
      display: inline-block;
      white-space: nowrap;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }
    .citation a,
    .citation-link {
      color: #8A8A94;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-bottom: 1px dotted rgba(255,255,255,0.22);
      transition: color 0.15s ease, border-color 0.15s ease;
    }
    .citation a:hover,
    .citation-link:hover {
      color: #34d399;
      border-bottom-color: #34d399;
    }

    /* 大数字 callout 专用结构：数字单独占一行 + 来源脚注独立小字行 + 解释段落。
       推荐与 .stat-callout 配合使用，避免把 .citation 直接塞进 .text-4xl 父元素里 */
    .stat-callout {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 6px;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }
    .stat-callout .stat-value {
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.75rem);
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #10b981;
      line-height: 1.05;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    }
    .stat-callout .stat-source {
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 400;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      color: #8A8A94;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }
    .stat-callout .stat-source a {
      color: #8A8A94;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-bottom: 1px dotted rgba(255,255,255,0.22);
    }
    .stat-callout .stat-source a:hover {
      color: #34d399;
      border-bottom-color: #34d399;
    }
  </style>
</head>

